        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana FP223, Solid Brass Oblong Pocket Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Deltana made Contemporary Oblong Flush Pull allows you to slide a pocket door in and out without the pull catching. For use on sliding doors, pocket doors, cabinet doors--any door where a flush pull is desired. Flush pulls are mortised into the face of the door. 3-1/2\" long by 1-1/4\" wide with a total depth of 5/16\". Available in 9 finishes with a 1/32\" thick made of solid brass base. Comes packaged with matching finish mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-FP223-Specifications.gif?v=1704354519\" width=\"306\" height=\"236\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Deltana FP223 Oblong Flush Door Pull Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/4-inch-contemporary-oblong-flush-pull-deltana-fp828\"><b>4 Inch Contemporary Oblong Flush Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana FP223 Solid Brass Oblong Flush Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Depth: 5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Cutout Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Cutout Length: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: 1/32\" Thick Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with matching finish mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FP223.pdf?v=1704262160\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana FP223  Dimensions  Diagram (PDF)</a></b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "3-1/2 Inch Contemporary Oblong Flush Pull | Deltana FP223",
                "description": "Oblong Pocket Door Pull Deltana FP223 - This Deltana made Contemporary Oblong Flush Pull allows you to slide a pocket door in and out without the pull catching. For use on sliding doors, pocket doors, cabinet doors--any door where a flush pull is desired. Flush pulls are mortised into the face of the door. 3-1/2 inches long by 1-1/4 inches wide with a total depth of 5/16 inches. Available in 9 finishes with a 1/32 inch thick made of solid brass base. Comes packaged with matching finish mounting hardware.",
